    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ROWENA DRAKE: Forgive me. I hoped seeing all these faces might make it hurt less.\nOLGA SEMINOFF: Ms. Rowena. Your guest is here.",
      "MS. REYNOLDS: This one will be very sad.\nROWENA DRAKE: Ms. Reynolds. Everything is prepared in the salon as your assistant specified.\nMS. REYNOLDS: So noisy. Your home.\nROWENA DRAKE: They’ll all be gone before we begin.",
      "MS. REYNOLDS: Ariadne Oliver. My nemesis.\nARIADNE OLIVER: We meet again. “The Unholy Ms. Joyce Reynolds.”\nMS. REYNOLDS: The press coined that one. Not sure if I like it.",
      "ARIADNE OLIVER: Dramatic? -- ridiculous --\nMS. REYNOLDS: An old crone --",
      "MS. REYNOLDS: No one touch me until the trance is ended. The effects are painful.\nMS. REYNOLDS: Alicia Drake. I believe it was you who called to me. We invite you.\nMS. REYNOLDS: Too many spirits. This house is spilling with the dead. Some souls can’t let go.\nDESDEMONA: Do we stop, Ms. Reynolds?"
    ]
  },
